PHISHING
AI-driven CloudZ and Silver Fox campaigns compromised **86 percent** of enterprises. Attack infrastructure targeted **UAE** and **Singapore** transit via smishing. Signal and Apple users faced targeted MFA-exhaustion attacks.

RANSOMWARE
ShinyHunters breached Canvas, disrupting operations at **Penn State** and **Texas A&M**. Global attacks rose **45 percent**, including **5.7 billion** attempts in Argentina. Qilin and Chaos strains targeted retail networks and obscured Iranian espionage.

BANKING TROJANS
TCLBanker infected **59** Brazilian applications via WhatsApp and Outlook. AI-generated NGate intercepted NFC data through Handypay. Mirax RAT compromised **220,000** devices via Meta advertisements. Anatsa achieved **10,000** malicious Google Play downloads.

CARDING
Physical credit card skimmers compromised retail point-of-sale systems, including two **Harris County Dollar General** locations. Escalating physical breaches forced retailers like Buc-ee's to implement strict gas pump restrictions mitigating gift card fraud.

DENIAL OF SERVICE
State agencies mitigated over **1,200** attacks. German infrastructure experienced a **25 percent** volume increase, enduring **100** severe daily strikes. Unpatched vulnerabilities, including **CVE-2026-7263** in cPanel, enabled critical remote DoS executions.

BEC ATTACKS
Adversaries successfully bypassed MFA via human-centric manipulation. Pine Bluff School District lost **$3.2 million**; Sri Lanka's Finance Ministry lost **$2.5 million**. Spanish authorities intercepted **59,000 euros**. A primary Nigerian BEC syndicate operative pleaded guilty.

ACCOUNT TAKEOVER
Regional ATO fraud surged **324 percent**. Attackers exploited zero-click **CVE-2026-24467** in OpenAEV and **CVE-2026-7567** in WordPress. Fraudulent Meta 2FA badges hijacked verified accounts. Telecoms reduced ATOs by **75 percent** using dynamic bot management.

DATA BREACH
The Canvas hack exposed millions of student records. Stormous ransomware dumped **33GB** of AMS Group data. Coupang Taiwan leaked **3.3 million** accounts. Nvidia exposed user information through a compromised Armenian partner.

THIRD PARTY RISK
A global academic software breach exposed widespread institutional data. Generative AI integration increased enterprise technical debt by **60 percent**. Software misconfigurations caused a **60 million euro** hospital deficit. Australian miners were breached via provider Scope Systems.

ATTACKS ON DIGITAL ASSETS
DeFi platforms recorded **$14 billion** in withdrawals following cyberattacks. North Korea's Lazarus Group executed **76 percent** of crypto thefts. A Trusted Volumes exploit drained **$5.9 million**. An operative received **78 months** for a **$250 million** hardware wallet heist.
